-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov 20 20:32:28 UTC 2026 - Dirk Müller <dmueller@suse.com>

- update to 2.4.1:
  * Fixed a crash when parsing ISO week dates with year `0000`
    (e.g., `0000W06`). Previously, this segfaulted on Linux aarch64.
  * Fixed the Windows ARM64 wheel build.
  * Build and test all wheels in CI.
  * Timestamps containing a null byte (`\x00`) now raise a
    `ValueError` (#188). Previously, parsing stopped at the first
    null byte and silently ignored everything after it.
  * Dropped Python 3.7 support
  * Added Python 3.15 support
  * Added PyPy 3.12 support

-------------------------------------------------------------------
